&gt;Tao&lt;/a&gt;, produce content for future reference, and foster communication with other experienced individuals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What I wanna emphasize is that without the help of friends,I probably wouldn&amp;rsquo;t have seen or learned so much. I am very grateful to them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wherever you go, remember those who have helped you or cooperated with you. Of course, you should be discerning in your friendships, but that&amp;rsquo;s another story. &lt;strong&gt;Anyways, never forget the help your friends,your teachers,your classmate and your family have given you. Don&amp;rsquo;t underestimate the power of the team, and don&amp;rsquo;t overestimate the power of the individual.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
